                if (C == colArticle || C == colChar1 || C == colChar2 || C == colChar3 || C == colcomments || C == colIssueUoM || C == colTransactionQty || C == colBaseUoM || C == colBaseQty || C == colMaterialGroup || dicTaxes.ContainsValue(C))
